	"data": "Cover Letter Christopher DiCarlo GeoSpace\n\nAugust 25, 2020\nGeoSpace Labs\nOcala, FL 34471\nRe: Unity Programmer\nDear Hiring Manager,\nI am applying for the position of Unity Programmer. \nI am very interested in this position. I believe I am a strong fit for this work, including experience with Unity, C#, VR, and 3D modelling. \nI have been studying and developing programs with Unity and C# for the last couple of years and have a high degree of knowledge and interest in VR development. I am very…",
